  "validity": "Genuine ReactOS _wcslwr_nt.c and shipping cnt-rust _wcslwr shim plus wcstr_slice, wraw_mut_slice and core_rs::casemap::lower_ascii. The host adapter maps ReactOS 16-bit wchar_t to uint16_t and compiles the source's relaxed no-op invalid-parameter handler. Inputs are either NULL or NUL-terminated UTF-16 with valid Unicode scalars. The implementation folds ASCII A-Z only; BMP non-ASCII and supplementary-plane scalars must be preserved. This grades in-place mutation, NUL handling and returned-pointer behavior on the host.",
